The command doesn't matter, it merely has to be a type of snack that
the pet enjoys (tripe for doggies and kitties, carrots for horses,
etc.)  You have to do it more than once to train them.

Learn to love your defaults.nh, and use the pettype command to set up
what kind of pet to start with.  Note that certain characters can only
start with one kind of pet.

What kind of pet?  Kitties and doggies are only tamed by tripe and
meatballs.  Check the spoilers for the odds of success.  An easier way
is to use a ?oT.
